   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Bud&#xfa;ci u&#x10d;itelia pre dne&#x161;n&#xfd; svet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future teachers for contemporary world</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Celkov&#xfd;m cie&#x13e;om projektu je vytvori&#x165; podmienky na za&#x10d;lenenie rozvojov&#xfd;ch t&#xe9;m do &#x161;tudijn&#xfd;ch programov na slovensk&#xfd;ch vysok&#xfd;ch &#x161;kol&#xe1;ch. &#x160;pecifick&#xfd;m cie&#x13e;om projektu je pripravi&#x165; podmienky na za&#x10d;lenenie cie&#x13e;ov, princ&#xed;pov a t&#xe9;m glob&#xe1;lneho a rozvojov&#xe9;ho vzdel&#xe1;vania do vysoko&#x161;kolsk&#xfd;ch &#x161;tudijn&#xfd;ch programov pedagogick&#xfd;ch smerov.&#xa0;Jedn&#xfd;m z hlavn&#xfd;ch v&#xfd;sledkov je&#xa0;&#x161;t&#xfa;dia - prieskum a anal&#xfd;za potrieb v oblasti implement&#xe1;cie cie&#x13e;ov, princ&#xed;pov a t&#xe9;m GRV na V&#x160; pedagogick&#xfd;ch smerov.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of the project is to create conditions to implement aims, principles and topics of GDE into pedagogical faculties of Slovak Universities. One of the main results of the project&#xa0;is research&#xa0;study and needs analysis referring to an implementation of aims, principles and topics of GDE at pedagogical faculties of Slovak Universities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
